// P3.9 / PS13 (previewing feature generation) and suppression, on the Control Arm with its
// second extrude added to the first (`control-arm add` set-up command: Sketch 1, Extrude 1 the
// hub, right web and eye, 40 mm; Extrude 2 the left web and eye, 25 mm, Add).
// 01 the Control Arm: one part, the rollback bar under Extrude 2.
// 02 Extrude 1 edited (double-click, PS13.1): the Part Studio is rolled back to it: the bar sits
//    under Extrude 1, Extrude 2 is greyed and not built, only Extrude 1's preview shows; its
//    dialog has Final (it isn't the last feature, PS13.3).
// 03 Final: the whole Part Studio after full regeneration with the edit (PS13.3): the left web
//    and eye of Extrude 2 are back, downstream of the edited extrude. The finished part is
//    opaque, with the edited extrude's own faces in the preview's translucent blue on top
//    (P3.11, P3.9 judge: the whole part was drawn as a see-through preview). Final shows
//    pressed (light blue, blue border and label) while it is on, and the view is zoomed to fit
//    (F) beside the dialog, so the arm isn't cropped (fix round 1); the later frames keep
//    that view.
// 04 Final off, the footer's slider dragged to the left (PS13.2): the model *before* Extrude 1
//    (only the sketch); 05 back to the right: *after* it again.
// 06 the dialog cancelled; the rollback bar dragged up under Extrude 1 (mid-drag: the grey
//    ghost where it will go); 07 dropped: Extrude 2 is rolled back (greyed, not built), the
//    part is Extrude 1's alone.
// 08 right-click Sketch 1 → "Roll to here" (P3D.1: the course's label): only the sketch is built.
// 09 right-click Extrude 2 → "Roll to end": all built again.
// 10 right-click Extrude 2 → Suppress: struck through and greyed, not built (the left web is
//    gone); 11 Unsuppress; 12 Ctrl+Z undoes the Unsuppress (each is one undo step).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("control-arm add"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("P"),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-control-arm"),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-extrude-1")),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-edit-extrude-1-rolled-back"),
        Click(ui("extrude-final")),
        Wait(20),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-final-shows-downstream"),
        Click(ui("extrude-final")),
        Wait(10),
        Drag(ui_at("extrude-rollback-slider", 0.7, 0.5), ui_at("extrude-rollback-slider", 0.05, 0.5)),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-slider-before"),
        Drag(ui_at("extrude-rollback-slider", 0.05, 0.5), ui_at("extrude-rollback-slider", 0.8, 0.5)),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-slider-after"),
        Click(ui("extrude-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(20),
        Press(ui("rollback-bar")),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("rollback-bar", 0.5, -2.0)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("feature-extrude-2", 0.5, 0.2)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("06-drag-rollback-bar"),
        Release,
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-rolled-back-to-extrude-1"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-sketch-1")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-roll-here")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-roll-to-sketch-1"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(ui("feature-roll-end")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09a-roll-to-end-menu"),
        Click(ui("feature-roll-end")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-rolled-to-end"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-suppress")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-extrude-2-suppressed"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-unsuppress")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-unsuppressed"),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("12-undo-suppressed-again"),
    ],
)
